    "created_at": "2016-11-07T19:43:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-07T19:43:06Z",
    "body": "AFAICT from telemetry, usage of createEvent(\"SVGZoomEvent\"/\"SVGZoomEvents\") is zero, or may as well be, so there seems to be no impediment to Gecko removing it.\n\nhttps://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1314388\n\nI'll put it on my to-do list to write a patch for Gecko to drop support when I'm next working (end of March), if no one beats me to it.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
